{"hw":"σοῦ1","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">σοῦ1</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σοῦ</span>, gen. of <span class=\"gk\">σύ</span>; also of <span class=\"gk\">σός</span>. (In <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hom.</span> </span> only the latter.)</div><div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">σοῦ2</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σοῦ</span>, <span class=\"lex-orth gk\">σοῦ</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">shoo! shoo!</b>, a cry to scare away birds, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Ar.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">V.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">209</span> </span>.</div></div>"}